  "raw_text_excerpt": "2026 ITALIAN GRAND PRIX\n04 - 06 September 2026\nThe FIA Formula 1 Technical Delegate\nFrom The FIA Formula 1 Technical Delegate\nTo The Stewards\nDocument 9\nDate 04 September 2026\nTime 08:30\nTitle Technical Delegate's Report\nDescription PU Elements used per Driver up to now\nEnclosed 13 ITA GP 26 TDR1.pdf\nJo Bauer\n\n2026 ITALIAN GRAND PRIX \n04 - 06 September 2026 \n  \n \nFrom :  The FIA Formula 1 Technical Delegate  \nTo :  The Stewards Date :  04 September 2026 \n  \n \nTechnical Delegate’s Report \n \n \nThe drivers entered in the 2026 Formula One Championship have used the below listed number \nof power unit elements during this season so far: \n \nICE Internal Combustion Engine TC Turbo Charger \nEXH EXH aust set MGU-K Motor Generator Unit – Kinetic \nES Energy Store unit PU-CE Power Unit-Control Electronics unit \nPU-ANC Power Unit ANCillary component \n \nN° Car Driver ICE TC EXH MGU\n-K ES PU-\nCE \nPU-\nANC \n81 McLaren Mercedes Oscar Piastri 3 3 2 2 2 2 3 \n01 McLaren Mercedes Lando Norris 3 3 3 2 3 4 4 \n63 Mercedes Geor ge Russell 4 4 4 2 3 3 5 \n12 Mercedes Kimi Antonelli 4 3 3 2 3 3 5 \n03 Red Bull Racin g RB Ford Max Verstappen 3 3 3 3 2 2 3 \n30 Red Bull Racin g RB Ford Liam Lawson 5 5 5  3 4 4 5 \n1"
